$MDESC::Type = "Defend and Destroy";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Defend & Destroy" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Tombaugh V" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Day" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> tribes are battling for survival on the remote planet of Ultima Thule.  After the Blood Eagle force the Diamond Sword from their new mining facility they loot the Paytonium and quickly move it to a secret supply base.  Diamond Sword seeking revenge and to prevent the Blood Eagle from using the Paytonium they send out numerous scouting missions until they find them.  Now having found them the Diamond Sword plan and blowing up the supply station with the Paytonium with large explosives.  The Blood Eagle must Prevent this and destroy the ship and the explosives.  The Diamond Sword must destroy the Paytonium and the suppy depot!  <f1>Map by:[HvC]Leviathan";
